      "explanation": "On the lands under Exception RM 70, a detached house is permitted only if the lot area is at least 550 square metres, the lot frontage is at least 15.0 metres and the side yard setback is at least 1.8 metres. The lands are also subject to Schedule 'D' Airport Hazard Map from former City of North York zoning by-law 7625.",
