    },
    "900.6.10(478)": {
      "explanation": "On the lands under Exception RM 478, the minimum lot area, minimum lot frontage and minimum side yard setback depend on the building type. The maximum building height is 9.5 metres for a detached house. For a fourplex or apartment building the side yard setback is 0.6 times the building height. No prevailing by-laws or sections apply.",
